# Same files on every PC, whatever core.autocrlf says: text is stored and checked out with LF,
# Windows scripts with CRLF, and files that are hashed or compared byte for byte are never touched.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.vbs text eol=crlf
*.pdf binary
vendor/** -text
test/fixtures/** -text
